==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*8 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Ursamajor|Ursmajors]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*5 [[LeMurr]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies here are only 100% magnification, but if you do not have any [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]], then this stage will be unnecessarily difficult despite them being 100%. Due to this, it is recommended to at least get the [[Aqua Crystal]] [[Treasure]] before attempting [[First Round (Expert)]], which you have to get through in order to get here. [[Treasure]]s aside, this stage is easier than [[First Round (Expert)]], so just throw on a few [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] cats like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]], [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Neo Psychocat]] or [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]] and you should be fine.

